            "updated": 1772656376349,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 36,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "Design a video game marketplace app where each listing must \ndisplay a pixelated thumbnail of the game, its title, the \nrelease year, and whether the user wants to \"Trade\" or \"Sell\"\nit.\n\nUse a \"Cyber-Purple\" background with neon pink borders and a \nblocky pixel font for headings, ensuring all body text remains a\ncrisp white for readability.\n\nIf an item is sold out, a \"Game Over\" stamp should appear \nover the image; for low-quality photos, the app should \nautomatically apply a filter to make them look intentionally \nvintage.",
            "textAlign": "center",
            "verticalAlign": "middle",
            "containerId": "rn5vZF917P3dmt5USPQev",
            "originalText": "Design a video game marketplace app where each listing must display a pixelated thumbnail of the game, its title, the release year, and whether the user wants to \"Trade\" or \"Sell\" it.\n\nUse a \"Cyber-Purple\" background with neon pink borders and a blocky pixel font for headings, ensuring all body text remains a crisp white for readability.\n\nIf an item is sold out, a \"Game Over\" stamp should appear over the image; for low-quality photos, the app should automatically apply a filter to make them look intentionally vintage.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 572
          },
